Source provenance

Architecture patterns (command registry, layering check, catalog and preview designs) are
modelled on the storytold Crafting Apps (LightCraft, FilmCraft, PhotoCraft, DesignCraft,
PdfCraft, WordCraft), which are MIT OR Apache-2.0. Any code adapted from them will be listed
here with repository, path and revision.

- crates/ui-egui/src/dock.rs: panel-identity enum, default split layout and "validate, else
  fall back to the default" restore are modelled on LightCraft crates/ui-egui/src/docking.rs
  (local study copy, craft-ui pinned at 5c874d51eeb3de70e735c8ce87a59a7dedd47675). Written
  fresh; no code copied. Docking itself is the craft-ui crate (storytold/craft-libs, same rev,
  MIT OR Apache-2.0), used as a dependency.
- crates/ui-egui/src/theme.rs: font stack (Inter first, JetBrains Mono for monospace, named
  "medium"/"semibold" families, egui defaults kept as fallbacks) and text-style sizes follow
  PhotoCraft crates/ui-egui/src/theme.rs install_fonts / text styles (local study copy).
  Written fresh; the font files are copied from PhotoCraft assets/fonts/.
- crates/thumbs/src/disk.rs: disk thumbnail cache layout (`<2 hex>/<32 hex>.<ext>`), temp +
  rename writes, LRU-by-mtime prune to 80 % of the budget, and the own-file-name check
  (`is_cache_file`) are adapted from LightCraft crates/preview/src/disk.rs (storytold/lightcraft,
  rev 701f78e, MIT OR Apache-2.0). Changed: PNG via the `png` crate instead of JPEG, a source-size
  text chunk, a head/tail content key, background prune and clear.
- crates/thumbs/src/hash.rs: SipHash-1-3-128 streaming hasher with fixed keys, adapted from
  LightCraft crates/preview/src/hash.rs (storytold/lightcraft, rev 701f78e, MIT OR Apache-2.0);
  different keys and length-prefixed byte input.

Other crates.io dependencies are listed in Cargo.lock; `cargo xtask deny` checks their licences
against deny.toml. One is called out here because it stands in for platform code:
- known-folders 1.4 (artichoke/known-folders-rs, MIT OR Apache-2.0, Windows only): the Windows
  Known Folder API (SHGetKnownFolderPath) for Desktop/Documents/Downloads/Pictures/Videos in
  crates/fs/src/real.rs. Used as a dependency; no code copied.

Sibling apps started by File > Open In (PhotoCraft, LightCraft, FilmCraft, PdfCraft, DesignCraft,
WordCraft; storytold, MIT OR Apache-2.0) are separate programs the user installs; nothing of them
is linked or bundled. Their catalog in crates/engine/src/open_in.rs (program names, install
folders, file extensions) was written from their main.rs, engine extension lists and
packaging/windows/*.wxs at PhotoCraft d43db3e, LightCraft 701f78e, FilmCraft 71438c6, PdfCraft
7163ba3, DesignCraft 17cf5b4, WordCraft 159b84f.
